+# Website gallery images
+
+The images in this folder are legally usable example/public-domain imagery added for the results gallery.
+
+For best conversion, replace these with genuine Pure Water Window Cleaning before/after photos when available:
+
+- `before-after-window-cleaning.jpg` — replace with a real window-cleaning before/after image.
+- `solar-panel-cleaning-public-domain.jpg` — replace with a real solar-panel, conservatory, gutter, or exterior-cleaning image.
+
+Keep filenames the same to update the website without changing code, or update `client/src/components/ResultsGallery.tsx` if you use different filenames.
+
+Important: do not use images copied from competitors, Google Images, or social media unless you own them or have permission.

